# The Bow Master's main node: a zone that rains arrows while the storm lasts,
# plus a third more on everything else they do.
#
# GMS places the zone where the player attacks, rains on it every 5 seconds for
# 2.5, and allows six zones at once if they don't overlap. Nothing here has a
# position, so the six zones are one rain and the trigger is dropped: the swing
# never pauses while a monster stands, so "when you attack with your own
# skills" means every five seconds.
#
# Four rains per cycle, not one. A 40-second battle analysis counts 29 uses and
# 203 hits: exactly seven lines a rain, and 32 rains is eight cycles of four.
# The four fall 0.83 seconds apart inside GMS's 2.5, which counts as one moment
# here, since a respawn takes longer than that.
#
# The rain grows with the number of enemies the SWING hits, not with its own
# reach. GMS says "if currently attacking more than one enemy", and a Bow Master
# fighting a boss hits one part of eight with Hurricane. If the rain counted its
# own reach, Zakum and Horntail would get the fifteen-line rain meant for
# farming.
#
# Magic Arrow's doubling applies to the arrowhead Enchanted Quiver equips, which
# this game models as that skill's Final Attack. Doubled, it goes past certain:
# one extra arrow for sure and a fifth of a second. GMS words it against Quiver
# Cartridge, whose 30% doubled is exactly Enchanted Quiver's 60%, which would
# give nothing to the only class that can cast this; so it is read as the rate
# doubling.
name: "Storm of Arrows"
description:
  "Arrows shot into the sky fall like rain. Unaffected by attack reflection."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BOW_MASTER_V skill_order: 1 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 41.0
  duration_seconds_per_level: 1.0
  base { final_dmg_pct: 0.155 }
  per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.005 }
  boost {
    skill_name: "Enchanted Quiver"
    final_attack_chance_mult: 2.0
  }
  pulse {
    label: "Arrow Rain"
    cast_interval_seconds: 5.0
    casts: 4
    max_enemies: 10
    lines: 7
    lines_per_extra_enemy: 2
    max_extra_lines: 8
    base { skill_pct: 7.80 }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.30 }
  }
}
